            h('p',{className:`mt-1 text-[9px] font-semibold leading-relaxed ${isChalan?'text-sky-700':'text-cyan-700'}`},isChalan?'The Chalan uses the exact A5 structure from your supplied PDF: company design, client, chalan number/date, 14-row table, terms, dispatch, signature/stamp and footer.':'Up to 14 items use the original bill. More than 14 items automatically continue using the multipage layout from your supplied PDF. Totals appear only on the final page.')
